{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive this deadly laser show and beat nostalgia?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Currently Under Development!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synth Laser is a dynamic laser maze rhythm game. Get ready to dodge and weave around the deadly and stunning laser show, built upon the outrun and synthwave music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game provides a breathtaking laser show with the precision of rhythm games. Players must dodge the zapping lasers, timing each movement to the beat of a mesmerizing synthwave soundtrack, creating a uniquely immersive flow state. Developed by solo indie creator Sarah Noor, the game blends razor-sharp gameplay with a stunning outrun aesthetic, offering a fresh take on the rhythm-action genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch a Music-based Laser show</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Synthwave style graphics and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and weave through the deadly lasers of the laser show</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the level and move side to side to dodge the lasers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966300?t=1773662733","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966300?t=1773662733","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966300/b2ab2d162a2419aac2ea48a45fff7783d05967c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773662733","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966300/b2ab2d162a2419aac2ea48a45fff7783d05967c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773662733","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4022160,"description":""}],"detai